{"case_name": "default-label-used-when-label-omitted", "policy_name": "semantic_implicit_label", "note": "the rule omits the label, so the classifier's default_label 'coding' concept is read; the query matches the coding phrase (cosine 1.0) so the rule fires", "services": {"embed": {"EmbedModel": {"writes code": [1, 0], "proves theorems": [0, 1], "please write some code": [1, 0]}}}, "request": {"route_trace": true, "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "please write some code"}]}, "decision": {"version": "1", "route_to": "CodingLLM", "matched_rule": "implicit-label-rule", "default_used": false, "outputs": {}, "trace": [{"condition": "classifier:topic", "score": 1.0, "result": true}]}}
{"case_name": "default-label-read-not-max", "policy_name": "semantic_implicit_label", "note": "the rule omits the label; the query is close to the 'math' concept (cosine 1.0) and orthogonal to 'coding' (cosine 0.0), but the omitted label resolves to default_label 'coding', not the max concept and not primary(), so the read score is 0.0 and routing falls open to default_model", "services": {"embed": {"EmbedModel": {"writes code": [1, 0], "proves theorems": [0, 1], "prove this theorem": [0, 1]}}}, "request": {"route_trace": true, "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "prove this theorem"}]}, "decision": {"version": "1", "route_to": "DefaultLLM", "matched_rule": "", "default_used": true, "outputs": {}, "trace": [{"condition": "classifier:topic", "score": 0.0, "result": false}]}}
{"case_name": "input-embedding-failure-fails-open", "policy_name": "semantic_on_error", "note": "fail_open's input embedding fails (stubbed null); with no on_error that is match_false, so open-rule misses and its trace entry carries no score. fail_closed scores a real 0 on the same input and also misses, so routing falls to default_model.", "services": {"embed": {"EmbedOpen": {"writes code": [1.0, 0.0, 0.0], "no embedding here": null}, "EmbedClosed": {"writes code": [1.0, 0.0, 0.0], "no embedding here": [0.0, 1.0, 0.0]}}}, "request": {"route_trace": true, "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "no embedding here"}]}, "decision": {"version": "1", "route_to": "DefaultLLM", "matched_rule": "", "default_used": true, "outputs": {}, "trace": [{"condition": "classifier:fail_open", "label": "coding", "result": false}, {"condition": "classifier:fail_closed", "label": "coding", "score": 0.0, "result": false}]}}
{"case_name": "zero-vector-input-fails-open", "policy_name": "semantic_on_error", "note": "a zero-length input vector has no direction, so fail_open's cosine is undefined and it fails (match_false). fail_closed scores a real 0 and misses, so routing falls to default_model.", "services": {"embed": {"EmbedOpen": {"writes code": [1.0, 0.0, 0.0], "all zeros": [0.0, 0.0, 0.0]}, "EmbedClosed": {"writes code": [1.0, 0.0, 0.0], "all zeros": [0.0, 1.0, 0.0]}}}, "request": {"route_trace": true, "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "all zeros"}]}, "decision": {"version": "1", "route_to": "DefaultLLM", "matched_rule": "", "default_used": true, "outputs": {}, "trace": [{"condition": "classifier:fail_open", "label": "coding", "result": false}, {"condition": "classifier:fail_closed", "label": "coding", "score": 0.0, "result": false}]}}
{"case_name": "dimension-mismatch-fails-open", "policy_name": "semantic_on_error", "note": "an input vector of a different length than the phrase vectors cannot be compared, so fail_open's cosine is undefined and it fails (match_false). fail_closed scores a real 0 and misses, so routing falls to default_model.", "services": {"embed": {"EmbedOpen": {"writes code": [1.0, 0.0, 0.0], "wrong size": [1.0, 0.0]}, "EmbedClosed": {"writes code": [1.0, 0.0, 0.0], "wrong size": [0.0, 1.0, 0.0]}}}, "request": {"route_trace": true, "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "wrong size"}]}, "decision": {"version": "1", "route_to": "DefaultLLM", "matched_rule": "", "default_used": true, "outputs": {}, "trace": [{"condition": "classifier:fail_open", "label": "coding", "result": false}, {"condition": "classifier:fail_closed", "label": "coding", "score": 0.0, "result": false}]}}
{"case_name": "phrase-embedding-failure-fails-open", "policy_name": "semantic_on_error", "note": "fail_open's reference phrase 'writes code' fails to embed (stubbed null). Reference phrases are embedded before the input, so the classifier fails right there and never asks for the input's embedding: no EmbedOpen stub for the input text is declared, and the strict fake would flag the call if it happened. With match_false the rule misses and its trace entry carries no score. fail_closed scores a real 0 and misses, so routing falls to default_model.", "services": {"embed": {"EmbedOpen": {"writes code": null}, "EmbedClosed": {"writes code": [1.0, 0.0, 0.0], "phrase cannot be embedded": [0.0, 1.0, 0.0]}}}, "request": {"route_trace": true, "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "phrase cannot be embedded"}]}, "decision": {"version": "1", "route_to": "DefaultLLM", "matched_rule": "", "default_used": true, "outputs": {}, "trace": [{"condition": "classifier:fail_open", "label": "coding", "result": false}, {"condition": "classifier:fail_closed", "label": "coding", "score": 0.0, "result": false}]}}
{"case_name": "failure-fires-via-match-true", "policy_name": "semantic_on_error", "note": "fail_closed's input embedding fails and it has on_error match_true, so closed-rule fires as if matched and its trace entry carries no score. fail_open scored a real 0 and missed first.", "services": {"embed": {"EmbedOpen": {"writes code": [1.0, 0.0, 0.0], "no embedding here": [0.0, 1.0, 0.0]}, "EmbedClosed": {"writes code": [1.0, 0.0, 0.0], "no embedding here": null}}}, "request": {"route_trace": true, "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "no embedding here"}]}, "decision": {"version": "1", "route_to": "MathLLM", "matched_rule": "closed-rule", "default_used": false, "outputs": {}, "trace": [{"condition": "classifier:fail_open", "label": "coding", "score": 0.0, "result": false}, {"condition": "classifier:fail_closed", "label": "coding", "result": true}]}}
{"case_name": "success-below-threshold-misses", "policy_name": "semantic_on_error", "note": "on_error acts only on failure. Both classifiers succeed with a real score of ~0.447, below the 0.5 threshold, so both miss (match_true does not rescue a real low score) and routing falls to default_model.", "services": {"embed": {"EmbedOpen": {"writes code": [1.0, 0.0, 0.0], "loosely about coding": [1.0, 2.0, 0.0]}, "EmbedClosed": {"writes code": [1.0, 0.0, 0.0], "loosely about coding": [1.0, 2.0, 0.0]}}}, "request": {"route_trace": true, "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "loosely about coding"}]}, "decision": {"version": "1", "route_to": "DefaultLLM", "matched_rule": "", "default_used": true, "outputs": {}, "trace": [{"condition": "classifier:fail_open", "label": "coding", "score": 0.4472135954999579, "result": false}, {"condition": "classifier:fail_closed", "label": "coding", "score": 0.4472135954999579, "result": false}]}}
{"case_name": "max-over-phrases-last-phrase-best", "policy_name": "semantic_scoring", "note": "a concept's score is the highest cosine over its phrases, not the first or the average; the query is close to the second phrase 'fixes bugs' (cosine ~0.995) and nearly orthogonal to the first, so the max comes from phrase two", "services": {"embed": {"EmbedModel": {"writes code": [1, 0, 0], "fixes bugs": [0, 1, 0], "mostly fixing bugs": [0.1, 1, 0]}}}, "request": {"route_trace": true, "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "mostly fixing bugs"}]}, "decision": {"version": "1", "route_to": "CodingLLM", "matched_rule": "route-CodingLLM", "default_used": false, "outputs": {}, "trace": [{"condition": "classifier:topic", "label": "coding", "score": 0.9950371900631851, "result": true}]}}
